  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given integral can be written as<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;(Dividing&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>16</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;to&nbsp;both numerator and denominator),</p><p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is the constant of integration.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>6</mn><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>12</mn></msup><mrow><mn>6</mn><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p>"
